Writeflow
Part of the FlowApps suite.

Writeflow is a modified version of "humanizer" (https://github.com/sgaofen/humanizer-local-model,
Copyright 2026 Stephen Yu), used under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (see LICENSE).
Changes: new name, branding and colors; a separate data folder and port; and added features
(AI-sounding score, flagged text, facts check, reading level, writing-style comparison)
in app/web/js/wf/. The original NOTICE follows.

